# Local agent configuration — personal, never shared. The committed project
# guidance lives in AGENTS.md, which is tracked on purpose: PROGRESS.md and the
# workflows refer to it. `scripts/` used to be ignored here too, but the three
# modules in it are real project code that the workflows run, so ignoring the
# directory only meant new files there went unnoticed. Its contents are tracked.
